ithubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T18:24:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T18:24:33Z","body":"> There hasn't been any action on this, and given that this was a change for Android Editor and breaks the main build on Android, and @m4gr3d has expressed desire to not support editor on 3.x, it may be worth reverting #68730, at least temporarily (until someone gets a chance to do more work on the editor, possibly myself).\n\nI'd advise against increasing the delta between 3.x and 4.x as it would make future cherry-picks (e.g: Android SDK updates) much harder.\n\nThe proper approach would be to evaluate whether the issue is reproducible on 4.x:\n- if it's, resolve the issue for both 4.x and 3.x\n- if it's not, track the 4.x fix and cherry-pick it in 3.x\n\n@syntaxerror247 You were planning to look at backporting the Android SDK updates to 3.x, could you take a look at this as well?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033169573/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://a